  ("Remove expectation: replace any dominant seventh with a triad or add2, and put V (major key) or bVII (minor key) in first inversion, e.g. bVII add2 over its third voiced as a minor seventh with two perfect fourths above.","Piano roll","No chord demands resolution"),
